{
  "name": "🏛️ Olimpo - Artemis Comando Telegram & Apify 60 Leads",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * 1-5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "cron-morning",
      "name": "Lembrete 08:00h (Seg-Sex)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "1769259678",
        "text": "🏛️ *Bom dia, Angelo!*\\n\\nQual nicho e região a *Artemis* deve prospectar hoje no Apify? (Meta: 60 leads)\\n\\n👉 *Responda com o comando:*\\n`/minerar <nicho e cidade>`\\n\\n_Exemplo:_ `/minerar pizzarias recife` ou `/minerar clinicas odontologicas caruaru`",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "telegram-morning-prompt",
      "name": "Prompt Matinal (Zeus)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "telegram-trigger",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger (Comando CEO)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Extrair texto da mensagem e validar comando /minerar\nconst msg = $input.item.json.message?.text || '';\nconst chatId = String($input.item.json.message?.chat?.id || '');\n\n// Aceita /minerar termo ou minerar termo\nconst match = msg.match(/^\\/?minerar\\s+(.+)$/i);\n\nif (!match) {\n  return [];\n}\n\nconst searchTerm = match[1].trim();\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    chatId,\n    searchTerm,\n    timestamp: new Date().toLocaleTimeString('pt-BR')\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-command",
      "name": "Validar & Extrair Nicho",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=⚡ *Comando Recebido com Sucesso!*\\n\\n🎯 *Nicho/Região:* _{{ $json.searchTerm }}_\\n📦 *Meta:* 60 leads com telefone, e-mail e Instagram.\\n⏳ *Status:* Artemis acionando o Apify em background. Em instantes envio o relatório!",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "telegram-ack",
      "name": "Confirmação Imediata (Telegram)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/compass~crawler-google-places/runs?token=apify_api_uf4HfMiYfRZXwlEKncVvy2VpModYQK4g9wr3&waitForFinish=180",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"searchStringsArray\": [\"{{ $('Validar & Extrair Nicho').item.json.searchTerm }}\"],\n  \"maxCrawledPlacesPerSearch\": 60,\n  \"language\": \"pt\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"br\",\n  \"exportPlaceUrls\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-apify-run",
      "name": "Executar Mineração no Apify (60 Leads)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://www.infinityondemand.com.br/api/apify/import",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"datasetId\": \"{{ $json.data.defaultDatasetId }}\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "http-import-crm",
      "name": "Importar Leads para o CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "1769259678",
        "text": "=✅ *Mineração do Apify Concluída!* 🎯\\n\\n📍 *Busca:* {{ $('Validar & Extrair Nicho').item.json.searchTerm }}\\n👥 *Total Processado:* {{ $json.total || 60 }} estabelecimentos\\n📥 *Novos Leads no CRM:* {{ $json.imported }}\\n⏭️ *Duplicados Ignorados:* {{ $json.skipped }}\\n\\n🚀 *A esteira de prospecção da Artemis já foi abastecida e está ativa!*",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "telegram-final-report",
      "name": "Relatório Final (Zeus Telegram)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1420,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
